WEBVTT

00:08:25.843 --> 00:08:30.307
utaratibu unapunguza matumizi, 
kuna nchi 180 ambazo zimajitolea

00:08:31.061 --> 00:08:34.188
kwenye utaratibu huu.
Tuzungumze kuhusu maswala ya sheria

00:08:34.664 --> 00:08:38.807
maafa yanyokabidhiwa.
Kwa sasa, ni mfumo wa biashara

00:08:38.831 --> 00:08:40.498
wa sekta ya tumbaku unaopingwa.

00:08:41.133 --> 00:08:46.056
Kwa sasa, sekta ya tumbaku

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:47.984
zinazohusika na tumbaku.

00:08:48.326 --> 00:08:51.714
Serikali zinalipa, 
jamii zinalipa,

00:08:52.222 --> 00:08:56.249
unalipa, ninalipa. 
Sekta ya tumbaku

00:08:56.273 --> 00:09:00.082
kwa pesa takriban 
trilioni moja dola za Marekani.